{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Home Manager 把家庭購物清單、庫存、開支、家務與筆記整合在同一個應用程式之中，所有資料只存放在裝置本機，毋須註冊帳戶，亦可離線使用，特別適閤家庭、情侶、室友，以及任何希望以更從容方式打理家居的人。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>離線管理購物清單與庫存</h2>\n<p>購物清單可為每項物品設定數量與單位，庫存不足時一鍵加入清單，買完勾選即自動回補庫存並可撤回。庫存頁記錄數量、單位、分類、到期日與最低存量，一眼看清低存量與即將過期的物品。開支方面提供每日帳目與每月統計，並可為每個分類設定預算提醒。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-569-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-570-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-571-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-572-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-573-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Home Manager: Shopping List</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T05:38:43.371736+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}